---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Referencias bibliográficas" active="/referencias">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="tag">Página de Referencias Bibliográficas</span>
      <h1>Fuentes consultadas</h1>
      <p>Todas las fuentes utilizadas en la elaboración de este blog.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container">
    <section>
      <h2>Libros y textos</h2>
      <ul class="brutal">
        <li>Stallings, W. (2019). <em>Computer organization and architecture: Designing for performance</em> (11th ed.). Pearson.</li>
        <li>Tanenbaum, A. S., & Austin, T. (2013). <em>Structured computer organization</em> (6th ed.). Pearson.</li>
        <li>Patterson, D. A., & Hennessy, J. L. (2017). <em>Computer organization and design: The hardware/software interface</em> (5th ed.). Morgan Kaufmann.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Documentación técnica</h2>
      <ul class="brutal">
        <li>National Instruments. (2023). <em>NI-DAQmx (National Instruments Data Acquisition) user manual</em>. https://www.ni.com/docs/en-US/bundle/ni-daqmx/page/usermanual.html</li>
        <li>National Instruments. (2023). <em>PCIe-6321 specifications</em>. https://www.ni.com/docs/en-US/bundle/pcie-6321-specs/page/specs.html</li>
        <li>PCI-SIG. (2022). <em>PCI (Peripheral Component Interconnect) Express base specification, revision 5.0</em>. https://pcisig.com/specifications</li>
        <li>Blackmagic Design. (2024). <em>DeckLink SDK (Software Development Kit) manual</em>. https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/developer</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Recursos web</h2>
      <ul class="brutal">
        <li>Magewell. (2023). <em>MWCapture SDK documentation</em>. https://www.magewell.com/capture/pro-capture</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Imágenes utilizadas</h2>
      <ul class="brutal">
        <li>National Instruments. (2024). <em>NI (National Instruments) PCIe-6321</em> [Imagen]. https://ni.scene7.com/is/image/ni/06160930</li>
        <li>National Instruments. (2024). <em>NI SCB-68A</em> [Imagen]. https://ni.scene7.com/is/image/ni/05101218-1</li>
        <li>ASUS. (2024). <em>PRIME B760M-A D4</em> [Imagen]. https://www.asus.com/motherboards-components/motherboards/prime/prime-b760m-a-d4/</li>
        <li>TechPowerUp. (2024). <em>Intel Core i5-13400 (front)</em> [Imagen]. https://tpucdn.com/cpu-specs/images/chips/2994-front.jpg</li>
        <li>Walmart. (2024). <em>Kingston FURY Beast 16GB DDR4 (Double Data Rate 4)</em> [Imagen]. https://www.walmart.com/ip/Kingston-FURY-Beast-16GB-2x8GB-3200MHz-DDR4-CL16-Desktop-Memory-Kit-of-2-KF432C16BBK2-16/316372856</li>
        <li>Walmart. (2024). <em>WD Blue SN580 1TB NVMe (Non-Volatile Memory Express)</em> [Imagen]. https://www.walmart.com/ip/WD-Blue-1TB-SN580-NVMe-Internal-SSD-WDBWMY0010BBL-WRWM/5080177169</li>
        <li>Corsair. (2024). <em>CX Series CX550</em> [Imagen]. https://www.corsair.com/us/en/p/psu/cp-9020277-na/cx-series-cx550-550-watt-80-plus-bronze-atx-power-supply-cp-9020277-na</li>
        <li>Amazon. (2024). <em>Fractal Design Pop Air</em> [Imagen]. https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i8gw20ZpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg</li>
        <li>Galco / Omega Engineering. (2024). <em>TJ36-CAXL-116U-6 thermocouple</em> [Imagen]. https://www.galco.com/media/catalog/product/cache/e129e64b17d2feb37acf3d4168a5d0ba/t/j/tj36-caxl-116u-6-omega-engineering.jpg</li>
        <li>Omega Engineering. (2024). <em>PR-13 RTD (Resistance Temperature Detector)</em> [Imagen]. https://br.omega.com/omegaFiles/Temperature/images/PR-13_l.jpg</li>
        <li>Omega Engineering. (2024). <em>PX309 pressure transducer</em> [Imagen]. https://br.omega.com/omegaFiles/Pressure/images/PX309_l.jpg</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
